at thinks you have food, it follows you around and waits to be fed.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","So Darcia's basically the same?",0,""],["say","avg3_100","That's not it at all! She's the Executive Director of United Harvest's Philae Branch—what could she possibly lack?",0,""],["say","avg3_100","Anyway, let me keep her calm for now to see if I can get any information about the orphanage out of her, then we'll find a chance to escape.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","Routes out of United Harvest and Philae City are already scouted.",0,""],["say","avg3_100","Having you around really helps, Amber.",0,""],["say","avg1_103","",0,""],["se","se_091"],["bgm",""],["show","avg1_138","b","011",0.35,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_110","c","010",0.65,null,null,0,null,0.0],["chd",1,0,"avg1_112","a","002",null],["ctl","avg3_134","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["hide","avg3_134",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["hide","avg2_985",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.0,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_138","b",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_138","b",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_138","Lady Darcia—\"servant of the Tyrant\"?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_138","b","006","flurry",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["show","avg2_985","a","008",null,null,1.05,0,null,0.0],["say","avg1_138","As the Executive Director of the Philae Branch, do you have any idea what you're saying?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_138","b",null,null,0.25,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.75,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a",null,null,null,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_062"],["say","avg2_985","Heh. Nyx... You truly don't understand.",0,""],["ctl","avg2_985","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Everyone in 